---
<button data-theme-toggle aria-label="Light or dark">Light/Dark</button>
<div data-comp="cards-n"><!-- section contract: composition=cards-n section=scope surface=base density=regular speech_act=detail -->
<CardsN heading="What does a strata clean include?" fs="A strata clean covers foyers, lifts, carparks and shared amenities on every scheduled visit \u2013 each area scoped and quality-checked." copy={({"heading": "What does a strata clean include?", "answer": "A strata clean covers **foyers, lifts, carparks and shared amenities** on every scheduled visit – each area scoped and quality-checked.", "before": ["The visit scope for strata cleaning services covers:"], "items": [{"term": "Foyers.", "text": "Entry glass polished, floors mopped, letterboxes and intercoms wiped.", "icon": "broom"}, {"term": "Lifts.", "text": "Walls, buttons and floors detailed; high-touch points sanitised every visit.", "icon": "spraycan"}, {"term": "Carparks.", "text": "Sweeping, litter pickup and stain spotting on a set rotation.", "icon": "map-pin"}, {"term": "Shared amenities.", "text": "Gym equipment, pool surrounds and common rooms reset, with consumables restocked under the restocking clause.", "icon": "building"}], "list_ordered": false, "qa": [], "links": [], "after": ["Bin rooms, storage cages and plant corridors join the rotation on monthly cycles. The scope also names what stays out: individual lots, balcony glass and appliances inside apartments remain the owner's job.", "Weekly cycles add deeper detail like skirting, cobwebs and bin-room wash-downs to the same written scope."]})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="comparison"><!-- section contract: composition=comparison section=pricing surface=muted density=regular speech_act=detail -->
<Comparison heading="How is strata cleaning priced?" fs="Strata cleaning prices follow building size, visit frequency and access points \u2013 written as a monthly invoice after a site audit." items={([{"term": "Visit frequency", "text": "multiplies them across the week", "icon": "calendar"}, {"term": "Monthly invoice", "text": "carries wages", "icon": "calendar"}, {"term": "Building size", "text": "sets the base minutes", "icon": "building"}, {"term": "Access points", "text": "decide whether the team services one entry or several", "icon": "users"}])} copy={({"heading": "How is strata cleaning priced?", "answer": "Strata cleaning prices follow **building size, visit frequency and access points** – written as a monthly invoice after a site audit.", "before": ["Building size sets the base minutes; visit frequency multiplies them across the week; access points decide whether the team services one entry or several. Amenity count, lift banks and carpark area adjust the figure inside that frame.", "Every engagement ships as a written quote first, so the owners corporation sees the rate structure before approval.", "Older walk-ups and new towers price on the same frame – stairwell count, lift banks and basement levels feed the audit, and committees compare like-for-like written quotes rather than hourly guesses.", "Buyers who ask about an hourly rate find it folded into the contract figure – the monthly invoice carries wages, super and insurance, then stays flat until scope changes."], "items": [{"term": "building size", "text": "Building size sets the base minutes; visit frequency multiplies them across the week; access points decide whether the team services one entry or several."}, {"term": "visit frequency", "text": "Building size sets the base minutes; visit frequency multiplies them across the week; access points decide whether the team services one entry or several."}, {"term": "access points", "text": "Building size sets the base minutes; visit frequency multiplies them across the week; access points decide whether the team services one entry or several."}, {"term": "monthly invoice", "text": "Buyers who ask about an hourly rate find it folded into the contract figure – the monthly invoice carries wages, super and insurance, then stays flat until scope changes."}, {"term": "written quote", "text": "Every engagement ships as a written quote first, so the owners corporation sees the rate structure before approval."}, {"term": "hourly rate", "text": "Buyers who ask about an hourly rate find it folded into the contract figure – the monthly invoice carries wages, super and insurance, then stays flat until scope changes."}], "list_ordered": false, "qa": [], "links": [], "after": [], "items_from": "terms"})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="faq"><!-- section contract: composition=faq section=faq-no-link-before-its-concept-defined surface=muted density=regular speech_act=objection -->
<Faq heading="What questions do strata managers ask?" fs="These questions cover cost, supplies and responsibility before a Melbourne strata manager books a site audit:" copy={({"heading": "What questions do strata managers ask?", "answer": "These questions cover cost, supplies and responsibility before a Melbourne strata manager books a site audit:", "before": [], "items": [], "list_ordered": false, "qa": [{"q": "What is strata cleaning?", "a": "shared-area contract work: foyers, lifts, carparks and amenities held to a written standard."}, {"q": "What is a good daily cleaning schedule for an apartment?", "a": "for shared areas: foyers and lifts daily, amenities weekly."}, {"q": "Do cleaners bring their own supplies?", "a": "yes; chemicals, cloths and machines come priced in."}, {"q": "What is the hourly rate or per-hour cost for a cleaner in Melbourne?", "a": "folded into a flat monthly invoice."}, {"q": "What is the 20 minute rule in cleaning?", "a": "a short daily reset beats a deep rescue; the roster applies the idea."}, {"q": "How often should a 1-bedroom apartment be cleaned?", "a": "inside lots sits with the owner; the contract covers common areas."}, {"q": "How to write a cleaning contract agreement?", "a": "verify, don't draft: scope, service levels, reporting, exit terms."}, {"q": "What are the three types of cleaning?", "a": "daily upkeep, periodic deep work and specialist services on one roster."}, {"q": "Are body corporate responsible for windows, and repairs in Victoria?", "a": "common-property glazing and repairs, yes; lot interiors sit with each owner."}, {"q": "What is a good cleaning fee?", "a": "a written scope compared across bidders."}, {"q": "What are the best strata cleaning services in Melbourne?", "a": "named crew, supervisor QA and reporting per invoice."}], "links": [], "after": ["The full service list sits under [all commercial cleaning services](/cleaning-services/) for strata buyers comparing sectors."]})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="footer-bar"><!-- section contract: composition=footer-bar section=footer surface=base density=compact speech_act=chrome -->
<FooterBar items={([{"label": "all commercial cleaning services", "href": "/cleaning-services/"}, {"label": "body corporate cleaning", "href": "/cleaning-services/body-corporate-cleaning-melbourne/"}, {"label": "strata window cleaning", "href": "/cleaning-services/strata-window-cleaning-melbourne/"}, {"label": "strata floor scrubbing", "href": "/cleaning-services/strata-floor-scrubbing-melbourne/"}, {"label": "strata cleaning checklist", "href": "/guides/strata-cleaning-checklist/"}, {"label": "strata cleaning contracts", "href": "/guides/strata-contracts/"}, {"label": "commercial office cleaning", "href": "/cleaning-services/office-cleaning-melbourne/"}, {"label": "get a strata cleaning quote", "href": "/contact/"}, {"label": "+61 3 7003 2223", "href": "tel:+61370032223"}])} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="form-panel"><!-- section contract: composition=form-panel section=end-act surface=brand density=spacious speech_act=act -->
<FormPanel cta={({"label": "get a strata cleaning quote", "href": "/contact/"})} copy={({"text": "A Melbourne strata manager calls +61 3 7003 2223 or [get a strata cleaning quote](/contact/) to book a site audit.", "cta": {"label": "get a strata cleaning quote", "href": "/contact/"}, "phone": "+61 3 7003 2223"})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="link-grid"><!-- section contract: composition=link-grid section=coverage surface=base density=regular speech_act=detail -->
<LinkGrid heading="Where does strata cleaning run in Melbourne?" fs="Strata cleaning runs across Melbourne's building corridors \u2013 CBD towers, Docklands apartments and Southbank mixed-use sites." items={([{"term": "Richmond", "text": "townhouse complexes", "icon": "check"}, {"term": "Hawthorn", "text": "garden complexes", "icon": "check"}, {"term": "Fitzroy", "text": "walk-ups", "icon": "check"}, {"term": "Carlton", "text": "student housing", "icon": "check"}])} copy={({"heading": "Where does strata cleaning run in Melbourne?", "answer": "Strata cleaning runs across **Melbourne's building corridors** – CBD towers, Docklands apartments and Southbank mixed-use sites.", "before": ["The roster also reaches Fitzroy walk-ups, Richmond townhouse complexes, South Yarra blocks, Carlton student housing and Hawthorn garden complexes, dispatched from the nearest hub.", "Buildings outside the corridor list run the same audit-first sequence once a route sits on the roster."], "items": [{"term": "building corridors", "text": "Strata cleaning runs across Melbourne's building corridors – CBD towers, Docklands apartments and Southbank mixed-use sites."}, {"term": "cbd", "text": "Strata cleaning runs across Melbourne's building corridors – CBD towers, Docklands apartments and Southbank mixed-use sites."}, {"term": "docklands", "text": "Strata cleaning runs across Melbourne's building corridors – CBD towers, Docklands apartments and Southbank mixed-use sites."}, {"term": "southbank", "text": "Strata cleaning runs across Melbourne's building corridors – CBD towers, Docklands apartments and Southbank mixed-use sites."}, {"term": "fitzroy", "text": "The roster also reaches Fitzroy walk-ups, Richmond townhouse complexes, South Yarra blocks, Carlton student housing and Hawthorn garden complexes, dispatched from the nearest hub."}, {"term": "richmond", "text": "The roster also reaches Fitzroy walk-ups, Richmond townhouse complexes, South Yarra blocks, Carlton student housing and Hawthorn garden complexes, dispatched from the nearest hub."}, {"term": "south yarra", "text": "The roster also reaches Fitzroy walk-ups, Richmond townhouse complexes, South Yarra blocks, Carlton student housing and Hawthorn garden complexes, dispatched from the nearest hub."}, {"term": "carlton", "text": "The roster also reaches Fitzroy walk-ups, Richmond townhouse complexes, South Yarra blocks, Carlton student housing and Hawthorn garden complexes, dispatched from the nearest hub."}, {"term": "hawthorn", "text": "The roster also reaches Fitzroy walk-ups, Richmond townhouse complexes, South Yarra blocks, Carlton student housing and Hawthorn garden complexes, dispatched from the nearest hub."}], "list_ordered": false, "qa": [], "links": [], "after": [], "items_from": "terms"})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="nav-bar"><!-- section contract: composition=nav-bar section=nav surface=base density=compact speech_act=chrome -->
<NavBar cta={({"label": "+61 3 7003 2223", "href": "tel:+61370032223"})} items={([{"label": "all commercial cleaning services", "href": "/cleaning-services/"}, {"label": "body corporate cleaning", "href": "/cleaning-services/body-corporate-cleaning-melbourne/"}, {"label": "strata window cleaning", "href": "/cleaning-services/strata-window-cleaning-melbourne/"}, {"label": "strata floor scrubbing", "href": "/cleaning-services/strata-floor-scrubbing-melbourne/"}])} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="sequence"><!-- section contract: composition=sequence section=process surface=muted density=regular speech_act=how -->
<Sequence heading="How does a strata cleaning contract run?" fs="Every strata cleaning contract runs the same four steps \u2013 site audit, scope plan, team assignment, supervisor QA." copy={({"heading": "How does a strata cleaning contract run?", "answer": "Every strata cleaning contract runs **the same four steps** – site audit, scope plan, team assignment, supervisor QA.", "before": [], "items": [{"term": "Site audit.", "text": "A supervisor walks the building, maps shared areas and notes access, alarms and resident rules.", "icon": "clipboard-check"}, {"term": "Scope plan.", "text": "The audit becomes a written task list with daily, weekly and monthly items.", "icon": "clipboard-check"}, {"term": "Team assignment.", "text": "The same trained cleaners take the site, inducted on its keys, hazards and layout.", "icon": "users"}, {"term": "Supervisor QA.", "text": "A supervisor inspects against the scope on a set cycle and signs off each visit.", "icon": "clipboard-check"}], "list_ordered": true, "qa": [], "links": [], "after": ["Strata buildings add resident-facing rules the audit captures early – quiet hours, lift bookings and foyer signage all land in the site notes before the first visit.", "The steps then repeat per building, so a second tower or an adjoining block runs the identical sequence."]})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="split-media"><!-- section contract: composition=split-media section=definition surface=muted density=regular speech_act=detail -->
<SplitMedia heading="What is strata cleaning?" fs="Strata cleaning is the scheduled cleaning of a building's shared areas \u2013 a trained team keeps foyers, lifts, carparks and amenities to a documented standard on a recurring roster." image={({"src": "/media/office-clean.jpg", "alt": "Whistle Clean cleaner detailing an office kitchen bench", "ratio": "3:2"})} copy={({"heading": "What is strata cleaning?", "answer": "Strata cleaning is **the scheduled cleaning of a building's shared areas** – a trained team keeps foyers, lifts, carparks and amenities to a documented standard on a recurring roster.", "before": ["The work answers to the strata manager and the strata management company, not to one household: the owners corporation signs for the scope, and the same residents judge the result every day.", "That is why the standard stays written down – shared areas hold no single owner to complain for them.", "Common-area work differs from a residential booking because the payer judges collectively.", "The owners corporation holds the budget, the committee holds the vote, and the manager answers when a foyer slips – so the scope stays written and reported.", "Strata Cleaning Melbourne runs this way for strata managers, owners corporations and building managers. Foyers mark the building's first impression, and the roster keeps it fixed."], "items": [], "list_ordered": false, "qa": [], "links": [], "after": []})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="stacked-hero"><!-- section contract: composition=stacked-hero section=hero surface=base density=regular speech_act=promise -->
<StackedHero heading="Strata Cleaning Melbourne" fs="Strata Cleaning Melbourne is common-area cleaning for strata buildings \u2013 foyers, lifts, carparks and amenities, run as a contracted service to a documented standard." cta={({"label": "get a strata cleaning quote", "href": "/contact/"})} image={({"src": "/media/team.jpg", "alt": "Whistle Clean cleaner sanitising a work surface", "ratio": "3:2"})} copy={({"heading": "Strata Cleaning Melbourne", "answer": "Strata Cleaning Melbourne is common-area cleaning for strata buildings – foyers, lifts, carparks and amenities, run as a contracted service to a documented standard."})} h1={true} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>
<div data-comp="stat-band"><!-- section contract: composition=stat-band section=frequency surface=base density=regular speech_act=proof -->
<StatBand heading="How often should common areas be cleaned?" fs="Common-area frequency follows traffic \u2013 foyers and lifts need daily attention, carparks and shared amenities a weekly cycle." items={([{"term": "Strata cleaning checklist", "text": "sets out the common-area items", "icon": "sparkles"}, {"term": "Common-area schedule", "text": "matches resident load", "icon": "users"}, {"term": "Daily attention", "text": "through the working week", "icon": "calendar"}, {"term": "Weekly cycle", "text": "with monthly detail passes on top", "icon": "calendar"}])} copy={({"heading": "How often should common areas be cleaned?", "answer": "Common-area frequency follows **traffic** – foyers and lifts need daily attention, carparks and shared amenities a weekly cycle.", "before": ["The common-area schedule matches resident load. High-traffic foyers and lift cars take daily attention through the working week; carparks, storage corridors and shared amenities hold a weekly cycle with monthly detail passes on top.", "The [strata cleaning checklist](/guides/strata-cleaning-checklist/) sets out the common-area items and their frequencies for committees auditing a scope.", "Quiet buildings stretch the roster; busy towers tighten it – the site audit sets the starting point and the visit log adjusts it.", "Short-stay towers and school-holiday buildings shift the load again, so the roster tightens around occupancy peaks instead of holding a flat weekly shape residents never see."], "items": [], "list_ordered": false, "qa": [], "links": [], "after": []})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" /></div>

